# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Everything committed here is world-readable and
# permanent — git history keeps it even after a later delete.
#
# The blanket `*` below is the safety mechanism, not an inconvenience. Runtime
# memory is allowed OUT of git on purpose:
#
#   JOURNAL.md      Ryder's private biographical journal. A scan against
#                   get_guardrails on 2026-08-26 matched every hard-excluded
#                   category — GPA, student ID, SSN, home address, middle name,
#                   and the marriage. This file must never be committed.
#   recent.md       flagged: GPA
#   team.jsonl      flagged: GPA, marriage
#   sessions.json   full model conversation history — unbounded, unreviewed
#   gui-transcript  full dashboard chat log — same
#   profile.json    a behavioural profile of Jerry; this repo is read by people
#                   hiring him, and an AI's read on how he thinks isn't for them
#
# To move this state to another machine (the Pi), use scp — NOT git.
# See CHEATSHEET.md "Moving memory between machines".
#
# If you need memory under version control, put it in a SEPARATE PRIVATE repo.
# Do not relax the rules below to get it into this one.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

*
!.gitignore

# Hand-authored planning docs — tracked source of truth, not runtime output.
!RULES.md
!GUARDRAILS.md
!FACTS.md
!PROFILE.md
!MEMORY.md
!AGENTS.md
!PERSONAS.md
!TOOLS.md
!CONFIG.md
!STRUCTURE.md
!ROLES.md
!SCHEDULE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!README.md

# Mayor's Academy material: the extracted ACADEMY_*.md notes are tracked source of
# truth; the two source PDFs (~67MB combined, scanned/image-heavy) stay local-only.
!academy-material/
academy-material/*.pdf
!academy-material/*.md
